 tes you to gather in The Muse for a relaxed\, yet refined dinner\, with fe
 llow members at a similar stage of life.\n\nThe evening unfolds over a tho
 ughtfully curated dinner\, complemented by subtle conversation prompts des
 igned to spark connection\, uncover shared interests\, and keep the dialog
 ue flowing throughout the evening.\n\nWhether you are newer to The ‘Hous
 e\, or simply looking to broaden your circle\, consider this an invitation
  to settle in\, share a table\, and get to know fellow members you may not
  otherwise have the chance to meet. Come for dinner\, stay for the convers
 ation\, and leave with a few new connections—and perhaps a little serend
 ipity.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for m
 embers only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to at
 tend\, will be charged in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or r
 estrictions by emailing happenings@thequin.com at least 72 hours before di
 nner service.
