SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Jefferson's Bourbon | Session I
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\n
 Event URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207953\n\nJoin us for a
 n intimate tasting experience with Jefferson’s Bourbon\, exploring the c
 raftsmanship\, character\, and creativity behind each pour. The evening be
 gins with a welcome cocktail and time to mingle before a guided tasting le
 d by Jefferson’s founder Trey Zoeller. A Kentucky native with deep famil
 y ties to American whiskey\, Zoeller founded Jefferson’s with his father
  in 1997 and has become known for challenging bourbon tradition through in
 ventive approaches to aging and blending\, earning him a place in the Kent
 ucky Bourbon Hall of Fame.\n\nAs straight tasting pours are passed\, Trey 
 will share the story of Jefferson’s while guiding members through the fl
 avor profiles\, production process\, and distinctive character of each sel
 ection. Following the tasting\, the evening opens back up for conversation
 \, giving members the opportunity to mingle\, revisit their favorites\, an
 d connect with Trey one-on-one for questions and a deeper dive into the wo
 rld of Jefferson’s Bourbon.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved
  for members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be serv
 ed. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior t
 o the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/207953
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
