SUMMARY:Día de los Muertos: A Taste of Oaxaca
LOCATION:Lunasol
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/208346\n\nIn cel
 ebration of Día de los Muertos\, Lunasol invites members to experience an
  Oaxacan-inspired dinner led by Chef Federico Remberg Roma. For one evenin
 g\, Chef Federico will present a five-course menu that explores the region
 ’s rich culinary heritage through layers of smoke\, spice\, and thoughtf
 ul origin cuisine.\n\nThe evening opens with refined interpretations of Oa
 xacan tradition before progressing to delicately balanced seafood and Wagy
 u beef accompanied by mole negro. Cacao and passion fruit bring the experi
 ence to a vibrant close\, while optional beverage pairings complement each
  stage of the menu. Members are invited to gather in the spirit of Día de
  los Muertos—to share a meal\, honor those we remember\, and celebrate t
 he connections that endure. \n\nMake a Reservation.\n\n*This five-course
  prix fixe menu is offered at $90 per person. Beverages\, taxes & club fee
 s are not included. Dining cancellations less than 48 hours in advance of 
 service\, or failure to attend\, are subject to a 100% charger per member/
 guest. Regular guest policies are in effect.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/208346
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
