SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: The Instinct of Opportunity with Mellody Hobson 
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 23 spots lef
 t\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/2
 09103\n\n4:30PM Reception\, 5:00PM Discussion\n\nJoin Sandy Edgerley\, Co-
 Founder of The ’Quin House\, and Mellody Hobson\, Co-CEO of Ariel Inve
 stments\, for a conversation about leadership\, investment\, and the insti
 nct to see possibility before it becomes obvious.\n\nFrom guiding Ariel’
 s growth to founding Project Level®\, Mellody has built a career around 
 ideas with the power to change industries. Together\, she and Sandy will e
 xplore what it takes to turn conviction into action\, with a closer look a
 t the momentum behind women’s sports. As new audiences\, investment\, an
 d influence reshape the field\, they will consider who gets to define its 
 future—and what this moment reveals about opportunity in business.\n\n*T
 his event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary li
 ght bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancella
 tions be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
